From: GPTware AI Team <dcmaxhome@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:23:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] MoE coop: wide rows on speculative-verify forwards
 (EXL3_MOE_COOP_ROWS)

EXL3_MOE_COOP_ROWS (8..64, default 8) routes verify windows up to that width through the coop kernels. Prompt prefill keeps the fused tier, so single-request output is independent of the setting. c8 +20 % at 64.
